{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"459b5a4b12b2ca0929884c296e82479f990b5c49c76874f4a699afa4e3d9e703","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2449},"chapter":{"number":60,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["祈求上帝的幫助"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大衛作的詩，交給樂長，叫人學習，調用「作證的百合花」。當時大衛跟美索不達米亞和瑣巴的亞蘭人打仗，約押回師在鹽谷殺了一萬兩千以東人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你遺棄了我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我們一敗塗地；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾向我們發怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你現在復興我們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你震動大地，將它撕裂。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你修補裂口，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為它要塌陷了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你叫你的子民吃盡苦頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我們喝令人踉蹌的酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你賜給敬畏你的人旗幟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可以擋住箭羽","poem":1},{"noteId":3},{"text":"。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你應允我們的禱告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"伸出右手拯救我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你所愛的人獲救。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"上帝在祂的聖所說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我要歡然劃分示劍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"丈量疏割谷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"基列是我的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"瑪拿西也是我的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮是我的頭盔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大是我的權杖。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押是我的洗腳盆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把鞋扔給以東，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要朝非利士高唱凱歌。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能帶我進入堅固的城池？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能領我到以東？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝啊，你拋棄了我們嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再和我們的軍隊一同出戰了嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你幫助我們攻打仇敵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為人的幫助徒然無益。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們依靠上帝才能取勝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必踐踏我們的敵人。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"「擋住箭羽」或譯作「為真理飄揚」。","reference":{"chapter":60,"verse":4}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/60.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/61.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/59.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}